<title>POLAND: Polish bonds auction timetable for Q2 1997.</title>
<headline>Polish bonds auction timetable for Q2 1997.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Finance Ministry on Friday announced the timetable of bond auctions for the second quarter of 1997. The amounts of the offers have not been given. NOTE: The actual amount of bonds on offer is announced a week before the tender.</p>
<p>     DATE		    BOND TYPE			BOND SYMBOL</p>
<p>    April 4		 fixed 2-yr			 AS0699</p>
<p>				fixed 5-yr			 OS0602</p>
<p>    April 8	   floating 10-yr			 DZ0407</p>
<p>			  floating 10-yr assimilated	 DZ0406</p>
<p>    April 17		fixed 5-yr assimilated	 OS0601 @</p>
<p>    April 22	   floating  3-yr			TZ0500</p>
<p>    April 23     index-linked  1-yr			RP0698</p>
<p>    April 24-May 5   subscription for index-linked 1-yr  IR0698</p>
<p>    May 5-July 31    public sale of floating 3-yr	  TZ0500</p>
<p>    May 7		   fixed 2-yr			 AS0699</p>
<p>				fixed 5-yr			 OS0602</p>
<p>    May 15		  fixed 5-yr assimilated	 OS0601</p>
<p>    May 21	index-linked  1-yr			 RP0698</p>
<p>    June  4		 fixed 2-yr			 AS1099</p>
<p>				fixed 5-yr			 OS1002</p>
<p>    June 3-August 29 public sale of index-linked 1-yr    IR0698</p>
<p>    June 11	   floating 10-yr			 DZ0707</p>
<p>    June 19		 fixed 5-yr assimilated	 OS0601</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
